.TH HOODMIN 8 "2026-10-19" "Hoodmin 0.2.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
hoodmin \- VPN management HTTP service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hoodmin --config /etc/hoodmin/hoodmin.json
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run as the unprivileged hoodmin account behind a trusted HTTPS reverse proxy.
The HTTP service remains available when configuration or PostgreSQL is unavailable.
/healthz reports process liveness; /readyz reports application readiness.
Connection details are logged server-side and are not sent to the browser.
.SH SEE ALSO
hoodmin-cli(8), /usr/share/doc/hoodmin/docs/uretim-kurulumu.md
